    "title": "WATCH: Minneapolis leaders hold press conference after mass shooting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Uren ,\n6 hours ago\nMinneapolis leaders are holding a press conference after three people were killed and several more were injured in a mass shooting downtown on Wednesday afternoon.\nThree people are dead, including the suspect, and six others were injured in a shooting at a high-rise apartment complex.\nWatch below as Minneapolis Mayor Jacob Frey and Minneapolis Police Chief Bill Peterson provide an update on the incident.",
